WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.250
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.210
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.930
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:09.390
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.020
It is Christmas today, how fun!

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.620
Presents, parties, everything's great!

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.330
So we're also going to...

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.720
Party!

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.290
Happy Merry Christmas!

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.080
Howa Howa

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.280
Kira Kira

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:06.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.800
I can do anything!

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:16.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:25.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:29.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:32.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:37.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:41.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:43.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.520
Howa Howa

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.730
Kira Kira

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:47.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:53.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:05.220
It's finished! Ya sure did it, Lulu!

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.860
Ya made it in time for tomorrow eve!

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:08.680
Yeah.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:12.060
I'm sure your mama-san'll be tickled right pink!

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:19.480
This jewelry was made for me by my Lulu, my goddess of good fortune.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:26.890
If I give her some new jewelry, I wonder if she can reclaim the radiance she had back then.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.380
Lulu.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.570
Your mama-san shines plenty on them variety shows, don't she?

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.780
There's no point for an actress to shine on variety shows!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:37.970
Lulu?

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:39.520
Come in.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:45.790
Lulu, since tomorrow is Christmas, I thought it might be nice to have a party.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.950
Really? Who did you invite this year?

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.720
And who did you get for a host, and a band?

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.550
Oh, nothing so overblown.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:57.720
I thought we'd invite some people from the neighborhood for a party here at home.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.520
Huh? A party here? 

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.630
You don't want to?

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:04.080
It's not that...

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.160
Lulu's Perfect Christmas!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.160
Episode 63

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:14.090
Ami-chan, you are so cute!

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.860
You're our little Christmas fairy!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:19.290
Party, party! Christmash, Christmash!

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.810
Merry, Merry!

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:24.370
So we're going to hang out at parties this year for Christmas?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:28.500
Today we're going to a party at an acquaintance's of Amu's mom, and we'll also have one with the family at home.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.030
And tomorrow is the Guardians' Christmas party.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:36.060
Well, you can never have too many Christmas parties. They're always fun, so why not?

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.020
Yup.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.310
Hey, Mom, what's the family throwing this party we're going to like?

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.810
It's at the home of a person I met for an interview, Yamamoto-san.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:48.380
We really hit it off.

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.100
If it was an interview for a housewives' magazine, then...

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.560
It's some charismatic housewife?

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.390
You'll just have to wait and see.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.270
Come on in!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:01.680
Welcome to our humble home!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.770
I'm so glad you could come.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.910
Huh? This is...

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.830
That's right, it's the actress Mayuzumi Kahoru-san!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.380
An actwess?! You so pwetty!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.520
Thank you.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:16.020
But the nameplate said Yamamoto.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.020
Mayuzumi is my stage name.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.500
My real name is Noriko De Morcerf Yamamoto.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.940
Please, come help yourself.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.890
I've prepared a ton of popular dishes from my restaurant.

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:32.120
Her husband is the owner-chef of the famous restaurant, Maxim De France, you know.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.100
Wow! That's a high-class restaurant!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.030
Wowy!

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:39.400
High-class? Please, don't embarrass me.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.810
Now now.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.750
Her mother is an actress.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.190
And her father is a chef at a famous restaurant.

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:49.150
And their name is Morcerf.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:50.270
Which means...

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:54.590
Papa, Maman, don't just stand outside talking, hurry and come-

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.180
Hinamori Amu!

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.700
Knew it.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:02.060
Thank you very much for the invitation.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:06.930
Merry Christmas!

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:16.720
Being able to eat food from Maxim De France is such a luxury.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.430
If you'd like, I could show you the restaurant itself next time.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:22.580
Oh, I didn't mean to ask for...

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.140
But yes, please do!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:29.670
How pretty. Actresses really are a different class, aren't they?

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:33.000
So have you done any films lately?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.390
I was thinking of resting here in Japan for a while.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.520
I only recently returned, so there's much I still don't know.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.600
I hope you'll all teach me many things.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.580
Here.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.790
Thank you.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:51.750
You are our guest.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:53.890
For now.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.060
Do not be angry.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.720
It's a wonderful party, don't you think?

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:00.470
Of course.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.640
It's a viscount's party, after all.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:03.830
Viscount?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.430
A nobleman.

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:07.270
You don't even know that?

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:10.850
I guess there really is no way we could be friends.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.450
I wonder why she's always so snippy with us? 

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.940
She is?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:16.890
Yes, she is.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.050
Oh, it's your Guardian Characters.

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:21.890
Speaking of which, you're a Character Bearer too, right?

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:26.890
I didn't intend to introduce her to you, since we're not friends and all, but...

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.510
Come on out, Nana.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.080
This is my Guardian Character, Nana.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.500
So cute!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.150
She is just like a doll!

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:41.060
Nana, please show these people our hospitality.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.970
Y'all just leave that to me, y'hear!

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.500
y'hear?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.290
What kind of a word is that?

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.140
It's not French, is it?

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.670
This here's a Nagoya accent!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.650
Don't be holdin' back, eat up!

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:55.200
Y'all forgot the toppin'!

00:06:58.490 --> 00:06:59.700
What is that?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:03.230
It's miso! Ya pile on this much, and my word!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.560
I-If you put that much on...

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.330
Just do it, y'all! All righty?!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.900
That's quite the extreme gap between looks and personality.

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:13.560
Oh? Where's Lulu?

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.870
She's busy.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.350
She don't got time to hang out with y'all all day.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.820
Busy?

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.760
Wowy!

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:26.850
My, why thank you.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.520
She's doin' her best to make this here party perfect.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.240
Lulu, here you are.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.350
Let me handle the dishes, okay?

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:43.430
I'm already finished, so don't trouble yourself.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:45.760
You have to entertain the guests, Maman.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.950
All you've been doing is helping out all day.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.840
Relax a little.

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:54.170
I know, I know. Now let's get you back to the living room.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:59.560
Lulu, your mama-san is right, you know.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.140
Y'all should just take it easy.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.080
But...

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:06.520
I can't believe I missed it!

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:16.180
How could I forget to decorate the tree? What a disgrace!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.710
It's a lot better than I thought it'd be.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.630
Never underestimate miso.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.030
No kidding!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:24.220
Guys, there's still cake when we get home, you know.

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:26.110
Yay!

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:27.350
Sheesh.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.260
Lulu?

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.100
Are you okay, Lulu?

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.160
I'm fine.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.520
If I don't get this decorated before people notice,

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.460
then my perfect Christmas party will be ruined!

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.680
Here.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:51.010
Thanks!

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.710
Hinamori Amu! What are you doing?

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.240
I'm helping you, Lulu.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.290
No, thank you!

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:01.430
My image as a perfect decorator is at stake!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.300
How dare you go and...

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.880
What do you think?

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.280
Looks good to me.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.470
Next, next!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.590
Wait, you guys!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.240
I'll do the other side.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.890
Ya should just let them help out.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.160
Fine, just do whatever you want!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.310
Put that over there.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.470
Fight, fight!

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.390
Finished!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.290
We finished, we finished!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.380
It's so darned cute!

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:10.470
What? If you think it's weird, just go ahead and laugh.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:12.370
It's fine.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.900
Your Nagoya accent is cute. You should use it all the time.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.420
You think?

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:18.560
Yeah!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.370
They are finally getting along!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:50.640
Wowy! Super!

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.630
The Christmas twee is all sparkly!

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.510
Wow, amazing!

00:10:58.390 --> 00:10:59.850
Good work,

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.450
you two. 

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.000
Oh, it was nothing.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.850
Lulu, thank you for working so hard today.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.600
But of course, Maman.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.930
Lulu seems happy.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:14.810
She really loves her mama-san there.

00:11:14.810 --> 00:11:16.750
They're picture perfect.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:20.390
You've helped out enough, please just enjoy yourself now.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:21.580
You, too, Amu-chan.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:23.320
Sure.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:27.100
And now your parents are going to work hard for you, Lulu.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:36.420
Ah, she really is pretty. That's an actress for you.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:40.090
Maman's true beauty is way more than that.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:44.140
This is a picture from when she won the prize at last year's World Film Festival.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.860
She is so lovely.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.620
Incredible.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:53.290
Lulu made the jewelry her mama-san was wearing.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:55.810
Wow, you're talented.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.410
Oh, something like that is simple.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:00.850
Hey, did you make that, too?

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:05.310
Of course, y'all! It's a present for her mama-san!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.340
It is all sparkly!

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.840
It's really pretty!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.730
Really?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.880
Yeah! I'm sure your mom will love it.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.080
Lulu, why don't you give it to her already?

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:21.430
Then she can wear it in front of everyone.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.560
Yeah, that'll be great!

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:26.040
I want to see your beautiful mom.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.970
I guess I have no choice, then.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.820
I didn't curl the ribbon.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.650
It'll be fine!

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:51.290
So, Mrs. Reindeer, show me the way tonight with that red nose of yours!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.300
You can count on me!

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.890
Your mom is the best!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.060
Huh?

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.930
Lulu?

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.460
Why, Mama?

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:15.200
The party was going great, and then you...

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.880
She said she was just trying to let you have fun, Lulu.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.650
And now your parents are going to work hard for you, Lulu.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.760
But that's not something an actress like her should do.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:28.880
Lulu?

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:37.830
What're you gonna do?

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:42.820
Only the Embryo will be able to restore my mother's former radiance.

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:48.500
They sure are good hosts, aren't they?

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:52.070
Yeah. It looks like Ami had a blast, too.

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:55.610
Lulu didn't show her face once after that, did she?

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:56.580
No.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.600
I'm quite worried.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:05.510
I don't think Lulu had much fun.

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:06.490
Really?

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:10.400
I really wanted Lulu to have some fun today, but...

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.170
There's still tonight, right?

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.140
We'll have lots of fun together, just the three of us.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:18.700
You're right.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.600
I hope Lulu comes home soon.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:25.810
I'm definitely going to get the Embryo.

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.560
Here, it's a Christmas present!

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.330
Here!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.440
Really?

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.100
Yeah, really.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.670
What a shock.

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:43.740
I've found you.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:50.500
I'm calling them Christmas presents,

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.680
but they're actually only store coupons.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:53.630
But...

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.960
You want people to be happy to take them, right?

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.180
Who are you?

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:02.200
You want them to take your presents, right?

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:08.180
This is magic jewelry.

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.690
It will allow your dreams to come true.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:21.970
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.890
? Character Change.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.200
Now, wreak havoc and call out the Embryo!

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:35.450
Present!

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.920
What?

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:43.500
You suddenly decided to give your mom a present?

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.590
I guess Lulu-chan rubbed off on you a little.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.860
Well, you know, maybe once in a while.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:50.850
Amu-chan!

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.450
I can sense a ? Egg!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:59.240
Take my present!

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.960
Why is he chasing me?

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.310
This ain't never happened before!

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:08.740
My present!

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:10.930
Present?

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:13.600
I won't allow it!

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.320
I won't allow it!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:20.640
I won't allow presents that aren't given by Santa!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.220
He's Character Transforming?

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:34.930
Character Transformation: Santa Dream!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:38.090
All presents not given by Santa

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:39.680
will be confiscated!

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:43.420
What is this?

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:51.060
Merry Christmas!

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:53.380
The present for your mama-san!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:56.020
Lulu, let's get it back!

00:16:56.020 --> 00:17:00.140
It doesn't matter. The only thing we need is the Embryo.

